{"id":"n72171-1-9","stage":1,"title":"콩 · 大豆","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72171-1-9-1","ko":"밭에 무엇을 심을 거죠?","zh":"打算在田里种什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밭에","meaning":"旱田","explanation":"밭：旱田；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밭","audio":"/audio/2d83da9727aa548fe737.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62087","senseId":"1","lemma":"밭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밭에","audio":"/audio/f15638014889929e1135.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇을","audio":"/audio/24dedd16c140f1fef242.mp3"}},{"text":"심을","meaning":"种植，种，栽","explanation":"심다：种植，种，栽；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"심다","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64968","senseId":"1","lemma":"심다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심을","audio":"/audio/4481dacb9d596e40973e.mp3"}},{"text":"거죠?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거죠","audio":"/audio/d739482dc8a726917f44.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d83da9727aa548f","term":"밭","zh":"旱田","audio":"/audio/2d83da9727aa548fe737.mp3","entryId":"62087","definition":"不储水的、种植谷物或蔬菜的农田。","pronunciation":["받"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"9945af5ffe48ce1f","term":"심다","zh":"种植，种，栽","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3","entryId":"64968","definition":"将草木等的根或种子埋到土里。","pronunciation":["심ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代与听话人较近的或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/929e3ebca1013cc3a923.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72171-1-9-2","ko":"콩이랑 옥수수를 심을까 해요.","zh":"我打算种豆子和玉米。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"콩이랑","meaning":"大豆，黄豆","explanation":"콩：大豆，黄豆；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"콩","audio":"/audio/e644a5866362c87c73e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72171","senseId":"1","lemma":"콩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콩이랑","audio":"/audio/5ba02a8d1a154591b968.mp3"}},{"text":"옥수수를","meaning":"玉米，苞米，棒子","explanation":"옥수수：玉米，苞米，棒子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옥수수","audio":"/audio/acc93fc5f905327ebe71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67589","senseId":"1","lemma":"옥수수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옥수수를","audio":"/audio/4cbc1f2becb11c101e02.mp3"}},{"text":"심을까","meaning":"种植，种，栽","explanation":"심다：种植，种，栽；을까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"심다","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64968","senseId":"1","lemma":"심다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심을까","audio":"/audio/4f9bd1df55aa606f975f.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","explanation":"하다：考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e644a5866362c87c","term":"콩","zh":"大豆，黄豆","audio":"/audio/e644a5866362c87c73e2.mp3","entryId":"72171","definition":"被一层黄色或黑色薄外皮包裹的圆形谷物，用于制作豆腐或大酱等。","pronunciation":["콩"]},{"id":"acc93fc5f905327e","term":"옥수수","zh":"玉米，苞米，棒子","audio":"/audio/acc93fc5f905327ebe71.mp3","entryId":"67589","definition":"植株高大，叶长，顶部长有须状的疏松团簇，